        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.108,
            0.885,
            0.154
          ],
          "content": "Because our logical steps are flawless, our initial assumption must be wrong. Therefore, $\\sqrt { 2 }$ cannot be expressed as a fraction. It is irrational."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.237,
            0.183,
            0.714,
            0.485
          ],
          "content": "",
